cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ThreadTM, please cite the paper and the software."
title: "ThreadTM: a reply-threaded topic model"
authors:
  - family-names: Caren
    given-names: Neal
repository-code: "https://github.com/nealcaren/threadtm"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  ThreadTM is a reply-threaded topic model: a logistic-normal topic model whose
  per-document prior is coupled along the reply tree, so a reply's topics are
  smoothed toward the comment it answers. This package is the standalone
  distribution of the model, whose numerical core is implemented and tested in
  the topica library.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "topica"
    authors:
      - family-names: Caren
        given-names: Neal
    repository-code: "https://github.com/nealcaren/topica"
    notes: "ThreadTM's numerical core; this package pins topica 0.58."
